:: Deadwood Transport Motors
<<set _transport to maplebirch.get('Transport')>>
<<set $Transport.shop to 'motors', $location to 'deadwood_transport_motors', $bus to 'harvest', $outside to 0>>
<<= maplebirch.t('deadwood-reblooms:transport:place:motors')>><br><br>
<<if !_transport.shopOpen>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The forecourt gates are chained together. Price cards are still propped against the windscreens, but no one comes out from the office when you stop to look.
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>Snow has collected between the parked cars, broken only by tracks along the pavement.
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Water beads on the cars behind the fence. The little roof over the office door offers no shelter on this side of the gate.
      <<elseif Time.dayState is 'dawn'>>The workshop doors are shut. The first traffic of the morning passes behind you on Harvest Street.
      <<else>>The workshop is quiet, and the keys have been taken off the hooks beside the office window.<</if>><br><br>
      A sign fixed to the gate reads <span class='blue'>"Open 08:00–18:00."</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      车行的两扇铁门用链条锁在一起。汽车挡风玻璃前仍立着价牌，你停下来张望，却没有人从办公室出来。
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>积雪填进停放的汽车之间，只有沿街的人行道上留着脚印。
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>铁栏后，车身上挂满水珠。办公室门前那片小雨檐，遮不到门外的你。
      <<elseif Time.dayState is 'dawn'>>车间大门紧闭。丰收街早起的车辆从你身后驶过。
      <<else>>车间里没有声响，办公室窗边挂钥匙的钩子也空了。<</if>><br><br>
      固定在铁门上的牌子写着：<span class='blue'>“营业时间：08:00–18:00。”</span>
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Cars stand on the forecourt, with motorcycles lined up behind the showroom windows.
      A mechanic backs a car out of the workshop.
      <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain' or Weather.isSnow>>Water drips from its wheel arches onto the concrete. Inside, a heater rattles beneath the desk.
      <<else>>A radio plays behind the open workshop door, briefly drowned out by an engine turning over.<</if>>
      The clerk at the desk looks up as you come in. "What can we do for you?"
    <<option 'CN'>>
      门前停着一排汽车，展厅橱窗后摆着摩托车。
      修理工把车倒出车间。
      <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain' or Weather.isSnow>>水从轮拱滴到水泥地上。屋里，柜台下的暖风机轻轻响着。
      <<else>>敞开的车间里传来收音机的声音，很快又被发动机启动的响声盖了过去。<</if>>
      你走进来，柜台后的店员抬起头。“想办点什么？”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<icon 'transport/car-showroom.png'>><<lanLink ['Car showroom', '汽车展厅'] 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>>
    <<set $Transport.shop to 'car', $Transport.notice to null, $Transport.offer to null>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<icon 'transport/motorcycle-showroom.png'>><<lanLink ['Motorcycle showroom', '摩托车展厅'] 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>>
    <<set $Transport.shop to 'motorcycle', $Transport.notice to null, $Transport.offer to null>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<icon 'transport/service.png'>><<lanLink ['Repairs and collection', '维修与取车'] 'Deadwood Transport Service'>>
    <<set $Transport.shop to 'garage', $Transport.notice to null>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<icon 'transport/taxi.png'>><<lanLink ['Taxi desk', '出租车柜台'] 'Deadwood Transport Taxi'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-transport-return>>

:: Deadwood Transport Dealer
<<set _transport to maplebirch.get('Transport')>>
<<set $location to $Transport.shop is 'bicycle' ? 'deadwood_transport_bicycle' : 'deadwood_transport_motors', $bus to _transport.shopPoint, $outside to 0>>
<<= maplebirch.t('deadwood-reblooms:transport:place:' + $Transport.shop)>><br><br>
<<if !_transport.dealerOpen>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        The bicycle shop's shutter has been pulled down over the window display. A tyre pump stands behind the glass beside a handwritten repair list. The little bell above the door stays silent when you try the handle.
      <<else>>
        The showroom doors are locked. Beyond the glass, price cards hang from <<if $Transport.shop is 'motorcycle'>>the handlebars of the motorcycles<<else>>the rear-view mirrors of the cars<</if>>. The sales desk is empty, with its forms tucked beneath a paperweight.
      <</if>><br><br>
      The opening-hours notice beside the door reads <span class='blue'>"08:00–18:00."</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        自行车店的卷帘遮住了橱窗。一根打气筒立在门边的玻璃后，旁边贴着手写的维修单。你试了试门把，门上的小铃没有响。
      <<else>>
        展厅的门锁着。隔着玻璃，可以看见挂在<<if $Transport.shop is 'motorcycle'>>摩托车车把<<else>>汽车后视镜<</if>>上的价牌。接待桌后没有人，表格压在镇纸下面。
      <</if>><br><br>
      门边的营业牌写着：<span class='blue'>“08:00–18:00。”</span>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
<<else>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-dealer-notice'>>
    <<deadwood-transport-notice>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        Bicycles line the shop windows. A bell rings above the door as you enter. The shopkeeper puts down a tyre pump and comes over.
      <<elseif $Transport.shop is 'motorcycle'>>
        Motorcycles stand in rows beneath the showroom lights. A clerk looks up from the counter. Helmets sit on a shelf behind them.
      <<else>>
        Cars fill the forecourt. Inside, a clerk looks up from a stack of registration forms and asks what you are looking for.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        自行车沿着橱窗排开。你推门进来，门上的铃铛响了一声。店主放下打气筒，向你走来。
      <<elseif $Transport.shop is 'motorcycle'>>
        摩托车在展厅灯下排成几列。店员从柜台后抬起头，身后的架子上摆着头盔。
      <<else>>
        门前停着一排汽车。展厅里，店员从一叠登记表中抬起头，问你想看看什么车。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-dealer'>>
  <i><<lanSwitch 'Journey estimates are from Harvest Street to the farmlands, using your current skill and weather.' '参考行程为丰收街至农田，按当前技能与天气估算。'>></i>
  <div class='deadwood-card-grid deadwood-transport-catalog'>
    <<for _model range _transport.models>>
      <<set _catalog_vehicle to $Transport.vehicles.find(vehicle => vehicle.model === _model.id) ?? null>>
      <<capture _model _catalog_vehicle>>
        <<deadwood-transport-vehicle-card _model _catalog_vehicle>>
          <<if _catalog_vehicle>>
            <<if _catalog_vehicle.stolen>>
              <span class='red'><<lanSwitch 'Stolen. Ask at the workshop about tracing it.' '已失窃。可到修车厂询问寻回。'>></span>
            <<elseif _catalog_vehicle.point is _transport.shopPoint and !_catalog_vehicle.garage>>
              <<shopicon 'register'>><<lanLink ['Sell', '出售'] 'Deadwood Transport Sell'>>
                <<set $Transport.selected to _catalog_vehicle.id, $Transport.notice to null>>
              <</lanLink>>
            <<else>>
              <<lanSwitch 'Sell' '出售'>> | <i><<lanSwitch 'Bring it here from ' '先将载具从'>>
              <<print _transport.catalog.name(_catalog_vehicle.garage ? 'home:' + _catalog_vehicle.garage : _catalog_vehicle.point)>><<lanSwitch '.' '带到这里。'>></i>
            <</if>>
          <<else>>
            <<icon `'transport/' + _model.id + '.png'`>><<lanLink ['Take a closer look', '看车'] 'Deadwood Transport Buy'>>
              <<set $Transport.offer to _model.id, $Transport.notice to null>>
            <</lanLink>>
          <</if>>
        <</deadwood-transport-vehicle-card>>
      <</capture>>
    <</for>>
  </div>
  <<if $Transport.shop is 'motorcycle' and !$Transport.helmet>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Motorcycle helmet: ' '摩托车头盔：'>><<deadwood-transport-money 8000>>
    <<if _transport.canPay(8000)>>
      <<icon 'transport/helmet.png'>><<lanLink ['Buy a helmet', '购买头盔']>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').service('helmet')>>
          <<updatesidebarmoney>>
          <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-dealer-notice', 'deadwood-transport-dealer')>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>>
    <</if>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
    <<icon 'transport/service.png'>><<lanLink ['Repairs and collection', '维修与取车'] 'Deadwood Transport Service'>>
      <<set $Transport.notice to null>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if ['bicycle', 'motorcycle'].includes($Transport.shop)>>
    <<deadwood-transport-repair-shop `$Transport.shop is 'bicycle' ? 'bicycle' : 'motor'` 'deadwood-transport-dealer-notice' 'deadwood-transport-dealer'>>
  <</if>>
  <br>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Transport Buy
<<set _transport to maplebirch.get('Transport'), _model to _transport.offer>>
<<if !_model or !_transport.dealerOpen>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the showroom', '返回展厅'] 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
<<else>>
  <<icon `'transport/' + _model.id + '.png'`>><<= maplebirch.t(_model.name)>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _model.id is 'used_saloon'>>
        There are scratches around the door handles. The clerk opens the bonnet and lets you hear the engine.
      <<elseif ['sports_car', 'convertible', 'supercar'].includes(_model.id)>>
        The low seats hold you close to the floor. The clerk waits beside the open door while you look over the dashboard.
      <<elseif ['luxury_saloon', 'luxury_suv'].includes(_model.id)>>
        The door closes with a heavy click. You run your hand over the smooth upholstery. The sounds of the forecourt are muffled inside.
      <<elseif _model.id is 'van'>>
        You slide the side door open and look over the rows of seats. The clerk folds the rear seats down to show you the space beneath them.
      <<elseif _model.id is 'delivery_van'>>
        The clerk opens the loading doors. The empty cargo compartment smells of rubber and fresh paint.
      <<elseif _model.kind is 'bicycle'>>
        You squeeze the brakes and turn the pedals. The shopkeeper adjusts the saddle while you hold the handlebars.
      <<elseif _model.kind is 'motorcycle'>>
        You settle onto the saddle with both feet on the ground. The clerk points out the ignition and fuel cap.
      <<else>>
        You sit behind the wheel. The clerk shows you the controls and opens the glove compartment to take out the handbook.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _model.id is 'used_saloon'>>
        门把手周围有几道划痕。店员打开引擎盖，让你听了听发动机的声音。
      <<elseif ['sports_car', 'convertible', 'supercar'].includes(_model.id)>>
        座椅很低，坐下后几乎贴着车底。店员站在敞开的车门旁，等你看完仪表盘。
      <<elseif ['luxury_saloon', 'luxury_suv'].includes(_model.id)>>
        车门沉沉地合上。你摸了摸柔软的座椅，门前的嘈杂声隔着车窗变得很轻。
      <<elseif _model.id is 'van'>>
        你拉开侧门，看了看几排座椅。店员放倒后排座椅，让你看看底下腾出的空间。
      <<elseif _model.id is 'delivery_van'>>
        店员打开货厢门。空着的货厢里带着橡胶和新漆的味道。
      <<elseif _model.kind is 'bicycle'>>
        你捏了捏刹车，转动脚踏板。店主让你扶住车把，替你调整坐垫。
      <<elseif _model.kind is 'motorcycle'>>
        你坐上车，双脚撑着地。店员指给你看点火开关和油箱盖。
      <<else>>
        你坐到驾驶座上。店员指给你看几个开关，又打开手套箱，取出车主手册。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-transport-vehicle-card _model>><</deadwood-transport-vehicle-card>>
  <<if _model.kind isnot 'bicycle'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The clerk asks to see your ID before filling out the registration.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        填写登记表前，店员让你出示身份证。
    <</language>><br>
    <<if _model.learner>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "This one is small enough for a provisional licence," the clerk says. "You'll need to complete basic training too."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “这辆排量小，有临时驾照就能骑。”店员说道。“基础训练也得完成。”
      <</language>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>><br>
  <<if $Transport.vehicles.some(vehicle => vehicle.model === _model.id)>>
    <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'You own this model.' '你已拥有这款载具。'>></span><br>
  <<elseif (_model.kind is 'bicycle' or $id gt 0) and _transport.canPay(_model.price)>>
    <<shopicon 'register'>><<lanLink `_model.kind is 'bicycle' ? ["Buy (0:05)", "购买 (0:05)"] : ["Buy (0:15)", "购买 (0:15)"]`>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').buy() and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Buy'>>
        <<goto 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif _model.kind isnot 'bicycle' and $id lte 0>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You need an ID.' '你需要身份证。'>></span><br>
  <<else>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot afford it.' '你买不起。'>></span><br>
  <</if>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the showroom', '返回展厅'] 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>>
    <<set $Transport.offer to null>>
  <</lanLink>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Transport Service
<<set _transport to maplebirch.get('Transport')>>
<<set $location to $Transport.shop is 'bicycle' ? 'deadwood_transport_bicycle' : 'deadwood_transport_service', $bus to _transport.shopPoint, $outside to 0>>
<<= maplebirch.t('deadwood-reblooms:transport:place:' + ($Transport.shop is 'bicycle' ? 'bicycle' : 'garage'))>><br><br>
<<if !_transport.shopOpen>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        The repair stand is empty. A bicycle with its rear wheel removed leans behind the locked door, a claim ticket tied to the handlebars.
      <<else>>
        The workshop doors are down. A dark line of old tyre marks runs beneath them, and the parts counter behind the side window has been cleared for the night.
      <</if>><br><br>
      A card beside the collection window reads <span class='blue'>"Repairs and collection: 08:00–18:00."</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        修车支架空着。一辆拆下后轮的自行车靠在锁好的门后，车把上系着取车单。
      <<else>>
        车间的卷门放了下来，旧轮胎印一直延伸到门底。旁边的小窗后，配件柜台已经收拾干净。
      <</if>><br><br>
      取车窗口旁插着一张卡片：<span class='blue'>“维修、取车：08:00–18:00。”</span>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
<<else>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-service-notice'>>
    <<deadwood-transport-notice>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        The shopkeeper lifts a bicycle onto a stand behind the counter. Spare tyres hang from hooks on the wall.
      <<else>>
        A mechanic wipes oil from a spanner. An engine rattles behind the open workshop doors. You wait beside the counter until the mechanic comes over.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
        店主把一辆自行车抬上柜台后的支架。墙上的钩子挂着备用轮胎。
      <<else>>
        修理工擦着扳手上的油。敞开的车间里传出发动机的声音。你在柜台旁等了一会儿，修理工走了过来。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-service'>>
  <<if !_transport.shopOpen>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'The mechanic shuts the workshop for the evening.' '修理工关上了车间，今天的营业时间已经结束了。'>></span><br><br>
  <<else>>
  <<if _transport.shopVehicles.length>>
    <<for _owned range _transport.shopVehicles>>
      <<set _model to _transport.catalog.models.find(model => model.id === _owned.model)>>
      <<capture _owned>>
        <<icon `'transport/' + _model.id + '.png'`>><<lanLink `maplebirch.t(_model.name)`>>
          <<set $Transport.selected to _owned.id, $Transport.notice to null>>
          <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-service-notice', 'deadwood-transport-service')>>
        <</lanLink>> — <<if _owned.stolen>><span class='red'><<lanSwitch 'Stolen' '失窃'>></span><<else>><<print _transport.catalog.name(_owned.point)>><</if>>
        <<if _owned.garage>><i><<lanSwitch '(in a garage)' '（车库内）'>></i><</if>><br>
      <</capture>>
    <</for>><br>
    <<if _transport.vehicle and _transport.shopVehicles.includes(_transport.vehicle)>>
      <<icon `'transport/' + _transport.model.id + '.png'`>><<= maplebirch.t(_transport.model.name)>><br>
      <<lanSwitch 'Condition: ' '车况：'>><<deadwood-transport-condition _transport.vehicle>><br>
      <<if !_transport.availableAtShop and _transport.recoveryCost gt 0>>
        <<if _transport.vehicle.stolen>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              The mechanic asks where it happened and writes down a description. "I'll put the word out. Someone will know where it's been left." The tracing fee includes collection, but any damage will need a separate repair.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              修理工问清出事的位置，记下车辆的模样。“我找人打听。总有人知道车被丢在哪儿。”寻回费用包括运回车行，损伤还得另外修理。
          <</language>><br>
        <<else>><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You give the vehicle's location to the person at the counter. They check the address and quote a collection fee.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你告诉柜台后的人车停在哪里。对方确认了位置，报出取车的价钱。
        <</language>><br><</if>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Collection fee: ' '取车费用：'>><<deadwood-transport-money _transport.recoveryCost>><br>
        <<if _transport.canPay(_transport.recoveryCost)>>
          <<icon 'transport/recovery.png'>><<lanLink `lanSwitch('Arrange collection', '请人取车') + ' (' + Math.floor(_transport.recoveryMinutes / 60) + ':' + String(_transport.recoveryMinutes % 60).padStart(2, '0') + ')'`>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').service('recover') and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Service'>>
              <<updatesidebarmoney>><<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-service-notice', 'deadwood-transport-service')>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>><br>
        <<else>>
          <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot afford the collection fee.' '你付不起取车费用。'>></span><br>
        <</if>>
      <<elseif _transport.availableAtShop>>
        <<if _transport.repairCost gt 0>>
          <<lanSwitch 'Repairs: ' '维修：'>><<deadwood-transport-money _transport.repairCost>><br>
          <<if _transport.canPay(_transport.repairCost)>>
            <<icon 'transport/service.png'>><<lanLink `lanSwitch('Repair', '维修') + ' (' + Math.floor(_transport.repairMinutes / 60) + ':' + String(_transport.repairMinutes % 60).padStart(2, '0') + ')'`>>
              <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').service('repair') and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Service'>>
                <<updatesidebarmoney>><<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-service-notice', 'deadwood-transport-service')>>
              <</if>>
            <</lanLink>><br>
          <<else>>
            <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot afford the repairs.' '你付不起维修费用。'>></span><br>
          <</if>>
        <<else>>
          <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'It is in good condition.' '车况良好。'>></span><br>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You have no vehicles to service here.' '你没有需要在这里维修的载具。'>><br>
  <</if>><br>
  <<deadwood-transport-repair-shop 'bicycle' 'deadwood-transport-service-notice' 'deadwood-transport-service'>>
  <<if $Transport.shop is 'garage'>>
    <<deadwood-transport-repair-shop 'motor' 'deadwood-transport-service-notice' 'deadwood-transport-service'>>
  <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<if $Transport.shop is 'bicycle'>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the shop', '返回店里'] 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>>
      <<set $Transport.notice to null>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Transport Petrol
<<set _transport to maplebirch.get('Transport')>>
<<set $location to 'deadwood_transport_petrol', $bus to _transport.shopPoint, $outside to 1>>
<<= maplebirch.t('deadwood-reblooms:transport:place:petrol')>><br><br>
<<if !_transport.shopOpen>>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
<<else>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-petrol-notice'>>
    <<deadwood-transport-notice>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Pumps stand beneath a canopy beside the road. Behind the kiosk window, an attendant follows the meter as a driver fills their tank.
      <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>The canopy lights shine on the forecourt. The attendant slides a tray through the hatch to collect the driver's money.
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Rain taps on the canopy. The driver ducks back under it after replacing the nozzle.<</if>>
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>A shoveled path leads from the pumps to the kiosk. Dirty snow piles up along the tyre tracks at the roadside.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      路边的棚下立着几台加油机。一个司机正给车加油，柜亭后的工作人员看着计价器上的数字。
      <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>棚下的灯照亮了场地。工作人员从小窗推出托盘，收取司机递来的钱。
      <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨敲着棚顶。司机挂好油枪，缩回棚下躲雨。<</if>>
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>加油机到柜亭之间铲出了一条小路。路边的车辙旁堆着被踩脏的雪。<</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-petrol'>>
  <<if _transport.shopVehicles.length>>
    <<for _owned range _transport.shopVehicles>>
      <<set _model to _transport.catalog.models.find(model => model.id === _owned.model)>>
      <<capture _owned>>
        <<icon `'transport/' + _model.id + '.png'`>><<lanLink `maplebirch.t(_model.name)`>>
          <<set $Transport.selected to _owned.id, $Transport.notice to null>>
          <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-petrol-notice', 'deadwood-transport-petrol')>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</capture>>
    <</for>><br>
    <<if _transport.vehicle and _transport.shopVehicles.includes(_transport.vehicle) and _transport.availableAtShop>>
      <<icon `'transport/' + _transport.model.id + '.png'`>><<= maplebirch.t(_transport.model.name)>><br>
      <<lanSwitch 'Fuel: ' '油量：'>><<print _transport.vehicle.fuel.toFixed(1)>> / <<print _transport.model.tank>> L<br>
      <<if _transport.fuelCost gt 0>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Fill the tank: ' '加满油箱：'>><<deadwood-transport-money _transport.fuelCost>><br>
        <<if _transport.canPay(_transport.fuelCost)>>
          <<icon 'transport/fuel-pump.png'>><<lanLink ['Fill the tank (0:05)', '加满油箱 (0:05)']>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').service('fuel') and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Petrol'>>
              <<goto 'Deadwood Transport Petrol'>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>><br>
        <<else>>
          <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot afford the fuel.' '你付不起油钱。'>></span><br>
        <</if>>
      <<else>>
        <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'The tank is full.' '油箱已经满了。'>></span><br>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You will need to bring a motor vehicle or motorcycle to the pumps.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你得把汽车或摩托车开到这里，才能加油。
    <</language>><br>
  <</if>><br>
  <<if _transport.fuel.garages.length>>
    <b><<lanSwitch 'Garage fuel delivery' '车库燃油配送'>></b><br><br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The attendant points out the metal cans behind the kiosk. Each holds <span class='teal'><<print _transport.fuel.terms.can_capacity>> litres</span>.
        A garage shelf holds <span class='teal'><<print _transport.fuel.terms.garage_cans>> cans</span>. The station can collect and refill your empty cans.
        Delivery costs <<deadwood-transport-money _transport.fuel.terms.delivery_fee>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        工作人员指了指柜亭后的金属油桶。每桶能装<span class='teal'><<print _transport.fuel.terms.can_capacity>>升</span>。
        车库的架子能放<span class='teal'><<print _transport.fuel.terms.garage_cans>>桶</span>，空桶可以交给加油站灌满。
        每次配送收费<<deadwood-transport-money _transport.fuel.terms.delivery_fee>>。
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<for _property range _transport.fuel.garages>>
      <<capture _property>>
        <b><<= lanSwitch(_property.name.EN, _property.name.CN)>></b><br>
        <<set _fuel_store to $Transport.fuel_stores?.[_property.id] or {cans: 0, litres: 0}>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Petrol cans: ' '油桶：'>><<print _fuel_store.cans>> / <<print _transport.fuel.terms.garage_cans>>
        — <<lanSwitch 'fuel: ' '燃油：'>><span class='teal'><<print _fuel_store.litres.toFixed(1)>> L</span><br>
        <<set _order to _transport.fuel.quote(_property.id, true)>>
        <<if _order>>
          <<if _transport.canPay(_order.price)>>
            <<icon 'transport/fuel-can.png'>><<lanLink `lanSwitch('Buy a full can', '买一桶燃油') + ' (' + Math.floor(_transport.fuel.terms.delivery_minutes / 60) + ':' + String(_transport.fuel.terms.delivery_minutes % 60).padStart(2, '0') + ')'`>>
              <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').fuel.deliver(_property.id, true) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Petrol'>>
                <<goto 'Deadwood Transport Petrol'>>
              <</if>>
            <</lanLink>> — <<deadwood-transport-money _order.price>><br>
          <<else>>
            <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot afford a full can.' '你买不起一桶燃油。'>></span><br>
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
        <<set _order to _transport.fuel.quote(_property.id, false)>>
        <<if _order and _transport.canPay(_order.price)>>
          <<icon 'transport/fuel-can.png'>><<lanLink `lanSwitch('Refill the stored cans', '灌满存放的油桶') + ' (' + Math.floor(_transport.fuel.terms.delivery_minutes / 60) + ':' + String(_transport.fuel.terms.delivery_minutes % 60).padStart(2, '0') + ')'`>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').fuel.deliver(_property.id, false) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Petrol'>>
              <<goto 'Deadwood Transport Petrol'>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>> — <<deadwood-transport-money _order.price>><br>
        <</if>><br>
      <</capture>>
    <</for>>
  <</if>>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Transport Sell
<<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-sell'>>
<<set _transport to maplebirch.get('Transport')>>
<<if _transport.dealerOpen and _transport.vehicle and _transport.shopVehicles.includes(_transport.vehicle) and _transport.availableAtShop>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _transport.model.kind is 'bicycle'>>
        The shopkeeper checks the chain and tyres, then gives you a price. "Leave it by the counter if you're selling."
      <<else>>
        The clerk checks the mileage and looks over the bodywork. "If you want to sell, I'll need the keys."
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _transport.model.kind is 'bicycle'>>
        店主检查了链条和轮胎，向你报了个价。“要卖的话，把车靠在柜台边就行。”
      <<else>>
        店员检查了里程，又绕着车身看了一圈。“要卖的话，把钥匙给我。”
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<icon `'transport/' + _transport.model.id + '.png'`>><b><<= maplebirch.t(_transport.model.name)>></b><br>
  <<lanSwitch 'Condition: ' '车况：'>><<deadwood-transport-condition _transport.vehicle>><br>
  <<lanSwitch 'Buyback offer: ' '回购报价：'>><<deadwood-transport-money `Math.floor(_transport.model.price * _transport.vehicle.condition / 200)`>><br><br>
  <<if (_transport.vehicle.arrears ?? 0) gt 0>>
    <span class='red'><<lanSwitch 'Settle the unpaid upkeep before selling.' '出售前需结清保养欠费。'>></span> · <<deadwood-transport-money _transport.vehicle.arrears>><br>
    <<if $money gte _transport.vehicle.arrears>>
      <<shopicon 'register'>><<lanLink ['Pay cash', '用现金补缴']>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').maintenance.pay('cash')>><<updatesidebarmoney>><<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-sell')>><</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <<else>>
      <span class='grey'><<lanSwitch 'You do not have enough cash to clear the upkeep.' '随身现金不足以结清保养欠费。'>></span><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('Finance')?.state.bank.opened and maplebirch.get('Finance').state.bank.balance gte _transport.vehicle.arrears>>
      <<icon 'finance/bank-withdraw.png'>><<lanLink ['Pay from your bank account', '从银行账户补缴']>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').maintenance.pay('bank')>><<updatesidebarmoney>><<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-sell')>><</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<shopicon 'register'>><<lanLink ['Sell', '出售']>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').service('sell') and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport Sell'>>
        <<goto 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the shop', '返回店里'] 'Deadwood Transport Dealer'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
